    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tl43](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tl43) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 15 2026 19km NE of Colonia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 9.6571 longitude 138.224. It impacted 7 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
